/* ── Element spec ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   guide sphere   → SphereGeometry(2,32,32) MeshBasicMaterial grey opacity 0.03
   silhouette     → LineLoop circle radius 2 in XY plane, #999 (main outline)
   equator        → LineLoop circle radius 2 in XZ plane, #bbbbbb
   vert axis      → Line dashed (0,-2.7,0)-(0,2.7,0) #888
   horiz axis     → Line dashed (-2.7,0,0)-(2.7,0,0) #888
   proton         → SphereGeometry(0.16,16,16) #1a3a8f at origin + white "+" label
   electron       → SphereGeometry(0.11,16,16) #6fb3d8
   meridian arc   → Line from (0,2,0) to electron along meridian #5599cc
